## Doctor

```bash
harness/doctor.sh
```

Read-only. Exit 0 = worth driving. Checks: process up, `/version` sha == `git rev-parse HEAD`, DB reachable, migrations applied, verification user present. Run it first whenever anything looks off; a failing doctor means `blocked`, not `failed`.

